---
/**
 * Confidential Self-Assessment shortcut — a compact floating pill at the
 * bottom-left, mirroring the concierge bubble at the bottom-right. Floats
 * above content like a chat widget, never blocks reading. Opens the quiz
 * modal via [data-open-quiz].
 */
---

<button
  data-open-quiz
  class="side-pill fixed bottom-6 left-6 z-[60] hidden cursor-pointer items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-ink2/90 px-5 py-3 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-gold uppercase backdrop-blur transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-gold hover:text-ink md:flex"
  aria-haspopup="dialog"
>
  <span class="side-tab-dot !m-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  Self-Assessment
</button>
